    {
      "uid": "zhcn:643a2757f30ec957824bf718",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她一边喃喃自语，一边热心地在手边的笔记本上记载着什么东西。\r\n我正盯着她看的时候——",
      "source_fingerprint": "776b88900e732900cb775be645acadc7dea959e78b6651f82ca16b63281ec212",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
