    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d59c1067035bf303af601cf4",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "训练员，那孩子叫做樱花千代王哦。\r\n虽然今天是和朋友一起来训练的，但平时都是自己一个人在努力呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "95d54a0aa647379ba1dfa3b40f9d80751c9fd0c3350337a03fdee942698fe563",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1069/storytimeline_041069001.json",
