    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9c8d6eafac289a7644cc50df",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "虽然没进行过坡道反复冲刺那样花哨的训练，\r\n但她每天早上都毫不懈怠地一直拼命地奔跑，\r\n然后就开始像那样在笔记本上进行分析。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1eaa823bfb893fbbea70375b8fe1ba4c0a76398acbb7d97824e4a69590b18516",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
