    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4355d0995ceaf6a72dfb07c5",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "一阵风突然刮来，她手中的笔记本脱手而出，落在我的脚边。\r\n虽然我只是晃眼一瞥，但依旧看见笔记本中写满了各种各样的句子。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9bcbb4a7566952b2bc8d9ef631d4ac10529b19a9c62ab927ad057fa5a6728168",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
